| Argument | Example / meaning |
| --- | --- |
| ldapsUrl | `ldaps://ldap.example.com:636` |
| bindPrincipal | `CN=svc-bwce,OU=Service Accounts,DC=example,DC=com`; AD may also accept a service-account UPN |
| bindPassword | Inject from your deployment secret mechanism; do not put in source control or logs |
| baseDn | `OU=Employees,DC=example,DC=com` (must cover every user you want to check) |
| filterTemplate | AD: `(&(objectCategory=person)(objectClass=user)(sAMAccountName={0}))` |
| username | `jdoe` |
| connectTimeoutMs | `5000` |
| readTimeoutMs | `5000` |
| searchTimeoutMs | `5000` |
